{
  "id": "papamap",
  "title": {
    "en": "PapaMap — changing tables dads can reach",
    "de": "PapaMap — Wickeltische, die Väter erreichen"
  },
  "shortDescription": {
    "en": "Find and map baby changing tables that fathers can actually reach",
    "de": "Wickeltische finden und eintragen, die Väter tatsächlich erreichen können"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "A changing table in the women's room is invisible to a dad with a baby. This map shows toilets and other places with a baby changing table, colored by whether a father can reach it: <span style='color:#117733'><b>green</b></span> = reachable (men's room, unisex, dedicated room, wheelchair toilet or sales area), <span style='color:#cc3311'><b>red</b></span> = women's room only, <span style='color:#555555'><b>grey</b></span> = a table exists but nobody has recorded which room it is in. Grey pins are the call to action: open one and answer the location question.",
    "de": "Ein Wickeltisch in der Damentoilette ist für einen Vater mit Baby unsichtbar. Diese Karte zeigt Toiletten und andere Orte mit Wickeltisch, eingefärbt danach, ob ein Vater ihn erreichen kann: <span style='color:#117733'><b>grün</b></span> = erreichbar (Herrentoilette, Unisex, eigener Raum, barrierefreie Toilette oder Verkaufsraum), <span style='color:#cc3311'><b>rot</b></span> = nur Damentoilette, <span style='color:#555555'><b>grau</b></span> = es gibt einen Wickeltisch, aber niemand hat eingetragen, in welchem Raum. Die grauen Pins sind der Handlungsaufruf: anklicken und die Standort-Frage beantworten."
  },
  "icon": "./assets/layers/toilet/baby.svg",
  "startLat": 53.5503,
  "startLon": 9.9937,
  "startZoom": 12,
  "layers": [
    {
      "id": "dad_toilet",
      "name": {
        "en": "Toilets",
        "de": "Toiletten"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "All public toilets, colored by changing-table reachability for dads",
        "de": "Alle öffentlichen Toiletten, eingefärbt nach Wickeltisch-Erreichbarkeit für Väter"
      },
      "source": {
        "osmTags": "amenity=toilets"
      },
      "minzoom": 12,
      "title": {
        "render": {
          "en": "Toilet",
          "de": "Toilette"
        },
        "mappings": [
          {
            "if": "name~*",
            "then": {
              "en": "Toilet {name}",
              "de": "Toilette {name}"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pointRendering": [
        {
          "location": [
            "point",
            "centroid"
          ],
          "marker": [
            {
              "icon": "circle",
              "color": {
                "render": "#ffffff",
                "mappings": [
                  {
                    "if": {
                      "and": [
                        {
                          "or": [
                            "changing_table=yes",
                            "changing_table=limited"
                          ]
                        },
                        "changing_table:location~i~(.*;)? *(male_toilet|unisex_toilet|dedicated_room|room|wheelchair_toilet|sales_area) *(;.*)?"
                      ]
                    },
                    "then": "#117733"
                  },
                  {
                    "if": {
                      "and": [
                        {
                          "or": [
                            "changing_table=yes",
                            "changing_table=limited"
                          ]
                        },
                        "changing_table:location~i~(.*;)? *female_toilet *(;.*)?"
                      ]
                    },
                    "then": "#cc3311"
                  },
                  {
                    "if": {
                      "or": [
                        "changing_table=yes",
                        "changing_table=limited"
                      ]
                    },
                    "then": "#555555"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "icon": {
                "render": "./assets/layers/toilet/toilets.svg",
                "mappings": [
                  {
                    "if": {
                      "or": [
                        "changing_table=yes",
                        "changing_table=limited"
                      ]
                    },
                    "then": "./assets/layers/toilet/baby.svg"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "lineRendering": [],
      "presets": [
        {
          "title": {
            "en": "a public toilet",
            "de": "eine öffentliche Toilette"
          },
          "tags": [
            "amenity=toilets"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tagRenderings": [
        {
          "id": "dad-status",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "if": {
                "and": [
                  {
                    "or": [
                      "changing_table=yes",
                      "changing_table=limited"
                    ]
                  },
                  "changing_table:location~i~(.*;)? *(male_toilet|unisex_toilet|dedicated_room|room|wheelchair_toilet|sales_area) *(;.*)?"
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "en": "<b style='color:#117733'>A dad can reach this changing table.</b>",
                "de": "<b style='color:#117733'>Ein Vater kann diesen Wickeltisch erreichen.</b>"
              }
            },
            {
              "if": {
                "and": [
                  {
                    "or": [
                      "changing_table=yes",
                      "changing_table=limited"
                    ]
                  },
                  "changing_table:location~i~(.*;)? *female_toilet *(;.*)?"
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "en": "<b style='color:#cc3311'>The changing table is in the women's room only — a dad cannot reach it.</b>",
                "de": "<b style='color:#cc3311'>Der Wickeltisch ist nur in der Damentoilette — ein Vater kann ihn nicht erreichen.</b>"
              }
            },
            {
              "if": {
                "or": [
                  "changing_table=yes",
                  "changing_table=limited"
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "en": "<b style='color:#555555'>A changing table exists, but nobody has recorded which room it is in.</b> Answer the location question below to fix this.",
                "de": "<b style='color:#555555'>Es gibt einen Wickeltisch, aber niemand hat eingetragen, in welchem Raum er ist.</b> Beantworte unten die Standort-Frage, um das zu ändern."
              }
            },
            {
              "if": "changing_table=no",
              "then": {
                "en": "No changing table here.",
                "de": "Hier gibt es keinen Wickeltisch."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "changing-table",
          "question": {
            "en": "Does this toilet have a baby changing table?",
            "de": "Gibt es in dieser Toilette einen Wickeltisch?"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "if": "changing_table=yes",
              "icon": "./assets/layers/toilet/baby.svg",
              "then": {
                "en": "A changing table is available",
                "de": "Ein Wickeltisch ist vorhanden"
              }
            },
            {
              "if": "changing_table=no",
              "then": {
                "en": "No changing table is available",
                "de": "Es ist kein Wickeltisch vorhanden"
              }
            },
            {
              "if": "changing_table=limited",
              "hideInAnswer": true,
              "then": {
                "en": "A changing table is available with limitations (e.g. it must be asked for)",
                "de": "Ein Wickeltisch ist mit Einschränkungen vorhanden (z. B. auf Nachfrage)"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "changing-table-location",
          "question": {
            "en": "Where is the changing table located?",
            "de": "Wo befindet sich der Wickeltisch?"
          },
          "questionHint": {
            "en": "This is the question that decides the pin color. Multiple answers are possible if there is more than one table.",
            "de": "Diese Frage entscheidet über die Farbe des Pins. Mehrere Antworten sind möglich, wenn es mehr als einen Wickeltisch gibt."
          },
          "condition": {
            "or": [
              "changing_table=yes",
              "changing_table=limited"
            ]
          },
          "multiAnswer": true,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "if": "changing_table:location=female_toilet",
              "then": {
                "en": "A changing table is in the women's toilet",
                "de": "Ein Wickeltisch ist in der Damentoilette"
              }
            },
